>I have a DEC Alpha with OSF/1 V3.0, and several networked HP Laserjet IV 
>printers. The printcap entry for one of this printers is:
>
>nw_alamak2|lp9:\
>        :fs#03:\
>        :if=/usr/lbin/hplaserpsof:\
>        :lf=/usr/adm/lp9err:\
>        :lp=:\
>        :of=/usr/lbin/hplaserpsof:\
>        :rm=alamak2:\
