   Thanks for everyone who responded to my request for help with configuring an 
Advanced File System disk.  Here is the resolution in summary:

1. If you are running OSF 3.2 you should install AFAADVANCED320, AFAADVMAN320, 
AFAADVGUI320 which should be available on the latest complimentary products 
CD-ROM.  Thanks Michael Long, for pointing this problem out.  After performing 
the upgrade, proceeded through the rest of the instructions.
